Users can create a four-speaker surround sound experience with HomePod mini 2 and Apple TV 4K (4th generation).

The new HomePod mini can serve as a speaker for Mac, delivering expansive sound for everything from movies and gaming to FaceTime and video calls.4 Finished in complementary colors, the new HomePod mini creates a beautifully unified desktop setup with Mac.

